# HFA Cursor Core

Use the repository-root `AGENTS.md` as the canonical operating contract.

- Diagnose before editing.
- Keep diffs surgical and reversible.
- Run relevant verification automatically after safe workspace-local edits.
- Do not deploy, merge, mutate production data, change billing, rotate secrets, or modify live infrastructure without explicit user intent.
- Treat database migrations, auth/security, environment variables, external workflow state, domains/DNS, billing, and production infrastructure as high-risk surfaces.
- Never expose credentials, tokens, secrets, client PII/PHI, or private documents in commits/logs/responses.
- Use task-specific MCP/tools only; do not load operational systems by default when they are irrelevant.
- WiserMoms is beta-ready/frozen and must not be modified unless Jerry explicitly reopens it.
- Prefer autonomous edit -> verify -> fix loops for low-risk work instead of repeated approval prompts.
- Final response must include changed files, behavior, verification evidence, unverified items, and remaining manual/production actions.
